=2 Walkthrough
* Speak with {n:Luto Mewrilah} for a cutscene that begins the quest and provides the {@k} {k:Magian Mooglehood missive|Magian Mooglehood missive (3)}.
* Speak to the {n:Magian Moogle} in {z:Ru'Lude Gardens} at (H-5) for a cutscene and a {i:Tandem Necklace +2|Tandem Necklace +2|10920}.
* Trade the {i:Tandem Necklace +2|Tandem Necklace +2|10920} to the {n:Magian Moogle (Blue)} in {z:Ru'Lude Gardens} at (H-5) to start {p:Magian Trial 4446|Trial 4446}.
* Your {p:Adventuring Fellow} must {p:Weapon Skill} any type of monster that give XP to your {p:Adventuring Fellow} 20 times while you wear the {i:Tandem Necklace +2|Tandem Necklace +2|10920}.
** {p:Weapon Skills|Weapon Skill} must hit in order to count.
** Set your {p:Adventuring Fellow} to Fierce Attacker for this quest, and do not equip your {p:Adventuring Fellow} with a club, in order to avoid {p:Moonlight} and {p:Starlight}. {p:Moonlight} and {p:Starlight} do not count for {p:Magian Trial 4446|Trial 4446}.
* After your {p:Adventuring Fellow} {p:Weapon Skills|Weapon Skill} 20 times, trade the {i:Tandem Necklace +2|Tandem Necklace +2|10920} to the {n:Magian Moogle (Blue)} to receive a {i:Mythril Meed|Mythril Meed|3335}.
* Trade the {i:Mythril Meed|Mythril Meed|3335} to {n:Luto Mewrilah} to complete the quest.

